  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed development would fail to provide a family size\r\ndwelling as part of the conversion and would give rise to the loss of a\r\nsingle-family dwelling. As such, the development is contrary to policies Policy\r\nHO2 of the draft Local Plan&amp;nbsp; (2021-2041) and H10 of the London Plan\r\n(2021).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of insufficient internal\r\nfloor to ceiling height for Flat C, would fail to support the creation of an\r\ninclusive environment in terms of daylight penetration, ventilation and\r\ncooling, and sense of space, resulting in a substandard quality of\r\naccommodation to the detriment of the residential amenities of future occupiers.\r\nAs such, the development is contrary to Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021),\r\nPolicy DM1 of the Local Plan (Development Management Policies) and Policy HO2\r\nof the draft Local Plan&amp;nbsp;(2021-2041).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed development provides poorly located and\r\nrestrictive subdivision of the rear amenity space for flat C and would visually\r\nbreak up the garden space and create unnecessary compact spaces which would\r\nbreak up the well spaced pattern of rear gardens. As such, the development is contrary\r\nPolicy D6 Of the London Plan (2021), Policy DM 1 of the Development Management\r\nPolicies Local Plan (2013) and Policy HO2 of the draft Local Plan&amp;nbsp;(2021-2041).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of the inaccurate and misleading\r\non-site parking provision, low PTAL level and the negative impacts on parking\r\ncapacity on Malvern Avenue would result in and detrimental parking capacity. As\r\nsuch, the development is contrary to Policies DM42 (Parking standards) and Policy\r\nHO2 of the draft Local Plan&amp;nbsp;(2021-2041).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
